<view class="page"><view class="title">设置 · {{account}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{offline}}" class="offline">当前离线，设置尚未同步。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="hint">正在读取本人设置…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="refreshPage">重新读取</button></view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="success">{{notice}}</view>
  <view class="card"><view class="subtitle">共享范围</view><view class="hint">类别和单条记录都需本人开启。现有共享设置两端共用；不默认共享。</view>
    <view class="row" wx:for="{{sharing}}" wx:key="key"><switch checked="{{item.enabled}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="shareToggle" disabled="{{busy}}"/><text>{{item.title}}</text></view><button class="secondary" data-kind="basic" bindtap="saveSharing" disabled="{{busy||loading}}">保存档案、日程、体重和代改设置</button><button class="secondary" data-kind="health" bindtap="saveSharing" disabled="{{busy||loading}}">保存计划、训练、餐食和照片设置</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card"><view class="subtitle">AI 与费用</view><view class="hint">单位为美元美分。读取服务器实际授权和用量；全局额度由后台限制，小程序不会提高。上传照片不自动发送 AI。</view><view class="hint" wx:for="{{services}}" wx:key="name">{{item.name}}：{{item.text}}</view></view>
  <view class="card" wx:for="{{consents}}" wx:key="key"><view class="subtitle">{{item.providerName}} · {{item.title}}</view><view class="hint">发送：{{item.scope}}</view><view class="row"><switch checked="{{item.enabled}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="consentToggle" disabled="{{busy}}"/><text>允许此用途</text></view><view class="hint">{{item.savedEnabled?'本人已授权':'未授权'}} · {{item.usage}}</view><view class="field"><text class="label">每月上限（美分）</text><input type="number" value="{{item.limit}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="consentLimit" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><button class="secondary" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="saveConsent" disabled="{{busy}}">保存这一项授权</button></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="subtitle">夜间计划方式</view><picker range="{{providerNames}}" value="{{providerIndex}}" bindchange="provider"><view>{{providerNames[providerIndex]}}</view></picker><button class="secondary" bindtap="saveProvider" disabled="{{busy||loading}}">保存本人夜间方式</button><view class="hint">继续使用同一后台北京时间 20:00 任务，不另建定时器。</view></view>
  <button class="secondary" bindtap="privacy">隐私与照片说明</button><button class="danger" bindtap="signout" disabled="{{busy}}">退出此设备／切换账号</button>
</view>
